Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sex, is it? Or shall we talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, now you'll get a poem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You put your arms around my shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrapped your thighs around my waist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Pressed your lips to the waiting hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And thoughts fill with dreams and longing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your tongue dancing somewhere in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.00,0:00:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Heard anything from Kate lately? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She asked about you yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She said it's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You should go over to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.00,0:00:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, Kate always keeps up appearances.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know she'd be glad if you came over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.00,0:01:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know she's worried about how you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Go over to her now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She needs it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.00,0:01:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And so do you.
